WEBVTT

00:07.862 --> 00:09.137
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.206 --> 00:10.827
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.310
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.379 --> 00:14.275
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.344 --> 00:17.310
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.379 --> 00:19.413
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.482 --> 00:21.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.482 --> 00:23.310
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.379 --> 00:25.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.068 --> 00:27.344
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.413 --> 00:29.137
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.206 --> 00:31.379
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.413
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.482 --> 00:35.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.482 --> 00:39.517
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.586 --> 00:40.862
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.724
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.793 --> 00:45.448
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.827 --> 00:50.310
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.896 --> 00:53.827
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.896 --> 01:00.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.965 --> 01:02.344
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

01:02.413 --> 01:05.344
- Oh, boy!
A circus.
- 哦，孩子！
马戏团。

01:05.413 --> 01:08.965
Squidward, you didn't tell me
the circus was in town.
章鱼哥，你没告诉我
马戏团在城里。

01:09.034 --> 01:10.206
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:10.275 --> 01:12.655
And it's in your house.
它就在你家里。

01:12.724 --> 01:14.103
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

01:14.172 --> 01:17.137
-Oh, good grief.
It's not a circus, you clown.
-噢，真可惜。
这不是马戏团，你这个小丑。

01:17.206 --> 01:21.310
It's an exterminator's
fumigation tent.
这是灭虫者的
熏蒸帐篷。

01:21.379 --> 01:24.758
Somebody's been feeding sea
urchins in this neighborhood,
有人在喂海
这附近的顽童，

01:24.827 --> 01:26.620
and they've infested my house.
他们已经侵扰了我的房子。

01:26.689 --> 01:27.896
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

01:27.965 --> 01:31.068
Ooh, what's that up there?
哦，那上面是什么？

01:34.379 --> 01:36.551
- Squidward's circus
is boring,
- 章鱼哥的马戏团
很无聊，

01:36.620 --> 01:40.586
and the cotton candy
is stale.
和棉花糖
已经过时了。

01:41.896 --> 01:43.793
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:43.862 --> 01:46.793
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

01:46.862 --> 01:49.965
It's not a circus,
and that's not cotton candy.
这不是马戏团
那不是棉花糖。

01:50.034 --> 01:53.103
D'oh, never mind.
噢，没关系。

01:53.172 --> 01:55.827
- Squidward, are you
going somewhere?
- 章鱼哥，你是吗？
要去某个地方吗？

01:55.896 --> 01:59.310
- I'll be staying at a hotel
for the next few days
- 我会住在酒店
未来几天

01:59.379 --> 02:03.172
for peace and quiet.
为了和平与安静。

02:03.241 --> 02:04.862
-Goodbye!
-Bye!
-再见！
-再见！

02:04.931 --> 02:06.241
Seasons greetings!
季节的问候！

02:06.310 --> 02:09.241
[festive music]
[节日音乐]

02:09.310 --> 02:13.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:14.000 --> 02:17.482
both: [vocalizing]
两者：[发声]

02:21.000 --> 02:22.689
- [mutters]
- [嘀咕]

02:22.758 --> 02:25.620
- Yes?
- 是的？

02:25.689 --> 02:27.724
- Uh, are you the manager?
- 呃，你是经理吗？

02:27.793 --> 02:32.068
- No, I just play one on TV.
- 不，我只是在电视上播放一首。

02:32.137 --> 02:34.448
I'd like a room.
我想要一间房。

02:34.517 --> 02:38.103
Well, lucky you.
We have one room left,
嗯，你很幸运。
我们还剩一间房

02:38.172 --> 02:40.413
but I just gave it away.
但我刚刚把它放弃了。

02:40.482 --> 02:42.241
- Well, how does
that make me lucky?
- 嗯，怎么样
这让我幸运吗？

02:42.310 --> 02:45.517
- Because I just
gave it to you.
- 因为我只是
把它给了你。

02:45.586 --> 02:49.931
- [mutters]
- [嘀咕]

02:50.000 --> 02:52.586
- Would you like a bell boy?
- 你想要一个行李员吗？

02:52.655 --> 02:54.689
- Why yes, thank you.
- 为什么是的，谢谢。

02:54.758 --> 02:57.482
- Here's your bell, boy.
- 这是你的铃，孩子。

02:57.551 --> 02:59.103
[laughs]
[笑]

02:59.172 --> 03:01.344
- [mutters]
- [嘀咕]

03:01.931 --> 03:03.103
[exhales]
[呼气]

03:03.172 --> 03:07.482
Well, now, this
is very nice indeed.
嗯，现在，这个
确实非常好。

03:09.241 --> 03:12.758
[sighs]
[叹气]

03:14.482 --> 03:18.137
Mm, this is heaven.
嗯，这里就是天堂。

03:19.310 --> 03:22.413
- [laughing excitedly]
- [兴奋地大笑]

03:22.482 --> 03:23.793
- Hello?
- 你好？

03:23.862 --> 03:25.517
Anyone there?
有人在吗？

03:25.586 --> 03:27.448
Hello?
你好？

03:27.517 --> 03:28.793
Hm.
嗯。

03:28.862 --> 03:31.206
[exhales]
[呼气]

03:31.275 --> 03:34.172
- [yelling excitedly]
- [兴奋地大喊]

03:34.241 --> 03:35.172
- Hello?
- 你好？

03:35.241 --> 03:36.689
Did someone just come in?
刚刚有人进来吗？

03:36.758 --> 03:38.241
[both laughing excitedly]
[两人兴奋地大笑]

03:38.310 --> 03:40.517
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

03:40.586 --> 03:43.310
- Don't you just love playing
Hotel Slam And Run?
- 你不是只是喜欢玩吗
酒店大满贯和奔跑？

03:43.379 --> 03:46.758
- I enjoy its...
- 我喜欢它...

03:46.827 --> 03:48.827
intellectual challenge.
智力挑战。

03:48.896 --> 03:53.620
[excited gibberish]
[激动的胡言乱语]

03:53.689 --> 03:55.827
- Huh?
- 啊？

03:55.896 --> 03:59.793
All right, I know I heard
something in here.
好吧，我知道我听到了
这里有东西。

03:59.862 --> 04:01.413
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:01.482 --> 04:04.758
Maybe I'm just
not relaxed enough.
也许我只是
不够放松。

04:05.724 --> 04:07.551
[smacks]
[咂嘴]

04:07.620 --> 04:08.896
Hmm.
唔。

04:10.689 --> 04:12.827
- Room service.
- [giggles]
- 客房服务。
- [咯咯笑]

04:12.896 --> 04:17.241
- Yes, hello. Do you have
the blue plate special today?
- 是的，你好。你有吗
今天的蓝盘特别吗？

04:17.310 --> 04:19.482
- Blue plate?
Yes, we have that.
- 蓝盘？
是的，我们有。

04:20.655 --> 04:22.620
Sir, all our plates are blue.
先生，我们所有的盘子都是蓝色的。

04:22.689 --> 04:23.482
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:23.551 --> 04:25.517
- Then I'll have that.
- 那我就来吧。

04:26.379 --> 04:28.551
- Oh, boys.
- 哦，孩子们。

04:28.620 --> 04:30.793
- Yes?
- 是的？

04:30.862 --> 04:32.793
Thanks for filling in
on the phone.
感谢您填写
在电话里。

04:32.862 --> 04:35.655
You may take the order
up to the room now.
您可以接受订单
现在到房间了。

04:35.724 --> 04:37.344
Here's your reward.
这是你的奖励。

04:37.413 --> 04:39.241
[both barking]
[两人都吠叫]

04:39.310 --> 04:40.413
[knocking]
[敲门声]

04:40.482 --> 04:42.724
- Room service.
- 客房服务。

04:42.793 --> 04:44.758
- Come in.
- 进来。

04:44.827 --> 04:47.862
[both shouting excitedly]
[两人兴奋地大喊]

04:49.965 --> 04:51.551
- Squidward?
- 章鱼哥？

04:51.620 --> 04:53.827
What a happy surprise.
多么令人高兴的惊喜啊。

04:53.896 --> 04:56.896
- SpongeBob, aren't you
going to introduce me?
- 海绵宝宝，不是吗
要介绍我吗？

04:56.965 --> 04:58.206
- Oh, it's Squidward, Patrick,
- 哦，这是章鱼哥，帕特里克，

04:58.275 --> 05:00.034
our next-door neighbor
and best friend.
我们的隔壁邻居
和最好的朋友。

05:00.103 --> 05:01.620
- Well, if you says so.
- 好吧，如果你这么说的话。

05:01.689 --> 05:02.931
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

05:03.000 --> 05:04.344
Get off me!
放开我！

05:04.413 --> 05:08.379
What are you doing
in this hotel?
你在做什么
在这家酒店？

05:08.448 --> 05:09.586
- This hotel is hosting
- 这家酒店正在接待

05:09.655 --> 05:12.310
the annual
Jelly Fishing Convention.
年度
果冻捕捞大会。

05:12.379 --> 05:14.862
Jelly Fishing Convention?
果冻捕捞大会？

05:14.931 --> 05:16.344
- Yes.
- 是的。

05:16.413 --> 05:19.517
And my room is over there.
我的房间就在那里。

05:19.586 --> 05:22.620
- And that's my room in there.
- 那是我的房间。

05:22.689 --> 05:24.482
both: Squidward's
in the middle!
两者：章鱼哥的
在中间！

05:24.551 --> 05:26.896
Squidward's in the middle!
章鱼哥在中间！

05:26.965 --> 05:28.275
- Conga line!
- 康加线！

05:28.344 --> 05:29.689
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

05:29.758 --> 05:31.586
both: ♪ Squidward's
in the middle ♪
两者：♪ 章鱼哥的
在中间♪

05:31.655 --> 05:33.586
♪ Squidward's in the middle ♪
♪ 章鱼哥在中间 ♪

05:33.655 --> 05:36.000
♪ Squidward's in the middle ♪
♪ 章鱼哥在中间 ♪

05:36.068 --> 05:40.827
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

05:40.896 --> 05:42.103
[exhales]
[呼气]

05:42.172 --> 05:44.241
all: ♪ Squidward's
in the middle ♪
全部：♪ 章鱼哥的
在中间♪

05:44.310 --> 05:45.827
♪ Squidward's in the middle ♪
♪ 章鱼哥在中间 ♪

05:45.896 --> 05:47.724
♪ Squidward's in the middle ♪
♪ 章鱼哥在中间 ♪

05:47.793 --> 05:49.827
♪ Squidward's in the middle ♪
♪ 章鱼哥在中间 ♪

05:49.896 --> 05:51.275
- You stay away from me.
- 你离我远点。

05:51.344 --> 05:53.448
I don't want to see
either of you
我不想看到
你们中的任何一个

05:53.517 --> 05:56.827
in any part of this hotel.
在这家酒店的任何地方。

05:56.896 --> 05:58.965
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:59.034 --> 06:01.551
I used to love the conga.
我以前很喜欢康加舞。

06:02.172 --> 06:05.586
Ahh, the hotel spa.
啊，酒店的水疗中心。

06:05.655 --> 06:08.620
Mm, this massage feels great.
嗯，这个按摩感觉棒极了。

06:08.689 --> 06:11.965
You have magic fingers.
你有神奇的手指。

06:12.034 --> 06:13.206
[exhales]
[呼气]

06:13.275 --> 06:14.896
both: Squidward!
两人：章鱼哥！

06:14.965 --> 06:18.275
Magic fingers!
神奇的手指！

06:18.344 --> 06:19.965
- No!
- 不！

06:20.034 --> 06:22.689
Stay away from me!
离我远点！

06:22.758 --> 06:23.862
- Huh.
- 嗯。

06:23.931 --> 06:26.896
Oh, we really do
have magic fingers.
哦，我们真的这么做
有魔法手指。

06:28.310 --> 06:32.758
- Oh, yes, I've still got
a dancer's body.
- 哦，是的，我还有
舞者的身体。

06:32.827 --> 06:33.793
One.
一。

06:33.862 --> 06:34.793
Two.
二。

06:34.862 --> 06:35.827
One.
一。

06:35.896 --> 06:36.827
Two.
二。

06:36.896 --> 06:37.827
Huh?
啊？

06:37.896 --> 06:40.241
both: Squidward!
两人：章鱼哥！

06:40.310 --> 06:44.275
- Stay away from me.
- 离我远点。

06:44.344 --> 06:45.689
- Heave!
- Ho!
- 举起！
- 嗬！

06:45.758 --> 06:46.862
- Heave!
- 举起！

06:51.482 --> 06:53.827
- No SpongeBob.
- 没有海绵宝宝。

06:53.896 --> 06:56.724
No Patrick.
没有帕特里克。

06:56.793 --> 06:57.551
[exhales]
[呼气]

06:57.620 --> 07:01.000
Ah, peace and quiet.
啊，和平与安静。

07:06.000 --> 07:09.172
[panicked shouts]
[惊慌的喊叫]

07:09.241 --> 07:10.448
both: Squidward!
两人：章鱼哥！

07:10.517 --> 07:13.896
- Leave me alone!
- 请别打扰我！

07:13.965 --> 07:15.379
- Heave!
- Ho!
- 举起！
- 嗬！

07:15.448 --> 07:16.448
[gargling]
[漱口]

07:16.517 --> 07:19.344
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:19.413 --> 07:20.344
[sighs]
[叹气]

07:20.413 --> 07:22.000
Finally.
最后。

07:22.068 --> 07:23.689
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:23.758 --> 07:27.310
[creepy musical flourish]
[令人毛骨悚然的音乐盛宴]

07:27.379 --> 07:29.482
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:30.517 --> 07:32.551
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:34.413 --> 07:37.275
[yelling]
[大喊]

07:37.344 --> 07:39.793
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:39.862 --> 07:41.448
[yelling]
[大喊]

07:41.517 --> 07:44.689
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:44.758 --> 07:45.862
Hm.
嗯。

07:45.931 --> 07:46.862
That's better.
这样更好。

07:46.931 --> 07:47.965
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:48.034 --> 07:49.827
Stay away from me.
离我远点。

07:49.896 --> 07:51.206
I'm warning you.
我警告你。

07:51.275 --> 07:53.758
I want to be alone.
我想单独待一会儿。

07:53.827 --> 07:54.965
[shudders]
[颤抖]

07:55.034 --> 07:57.344
- Oh, well, if you
want to be alone,
- 哦，好吧，如果你
想要一个人呆着，

07:57.413 --> 08:00.655
don't go into the room
behind you.
不要进入房间
在你身后。

08:00.724 --> 08:04.448
Wait, are you two
in there already?
等等，你们两个吗
已经在那里了？

08:04.517 --> 08:06.137
- No, silly.
- 不，傻瓜。

08:06.206 --> 08:09.517
That's where the jelly fishing
convention is.
这就是钓果冻的地方
康福特群岛

08:09.586 --> 08:11.655
- Welcome, Jelly Fisher.
- 欢迎，果冻费舍尔。

08:11.724 --> 08:13.172
You must be a newbie.
你一定是个新手。

08:13.241 --> 08:14.172
- Huh?
- 啊？

08:14.241 --> 08:15.241
[stammering]
[结巴]

08:15.310 --> 08:19.000
- Jelly Fishing!
Whoo-hoo!
- 果冻钓鱼！
呼呼！

08:19.068 --> 08:21.551
[cheering]
[欢呼]

08:26.551 --> 08:29.482
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:29.551 --> 08:31.103
- Welcome, newbie!
- 欢迎，新手！

08:31.172 --> 08:32.172
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:33.310 --> 08:34.517
- Jelly hug.
- 果冻拥抱。

08:34.586 --> 08:36.724
- [yells]
- [大喊]

08:38.137 --> 08:39.655
Hm?
嗯？

08:41.172 --> 08:42.793
Nooooooooooo!
不呜呜！

08:42.862 --> 08:45.620
All: Jelly Fishing.
Jelly Fishing.
全部：果冻钓鱼。
果冻钓鱼。

08:45.689 --> 08:47.068
Jelly Fishing.
果冻钓鱼。

08:48.620 --> 08:50.586
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

08:50.655 --> 08:52.965
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:53.034 --> 08:56.137
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

08:56.206 --> 08:58.965
both: Hi, Squidward.
两人：嗨，章鱼哥。

08:59.034 --> 09:01.310
- Squidward,
everyone loves you.
- 章鱼哥，
每个人都爱你。

09:01.379 --> 09:05.482
Are you having the funnest
fun fun fun time ever?
你有最好玩的吗
有趣有趣的有趣时光吗？

09:05.551 --> 09:07.172
- I am not fun.
- 我不好玩。

09:07.241 --> 09:10.413
Everybody loves me so much,
they won't let me leave.
大家都很爱我，
他们不会让我离开。

09:10.482 --> 09:13.551
- Hey, Squidward,
we love you, man.
- 嘿，章鱼哥，
我们爱你，伙计。

09:13.620 --> 09:17.172
- You belong with us now.
- 你现在属于我们了。

09:20.137 --> 09:23.172
- Say, if I put
that dumb thing on,
- 说，如果我把
那个愚蠢的东西，

09:23.241 --> 09:27.758
I can sneak out of here without
anybody knowing it's me.
我可以偷偷溜出这里，无需
任何人都知道是我。

09:29.275 --> 09:30.482
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:30.551 --> 09:32.724
[chuckles]
Goodbye, jelly-smellies.
[笑声]
再见，果冻味。

09:32.793 --> 09:37.344
I'm outta here, and back
to peace and quiet in my room.
我离开这里又回来了
我的房间里安静祥和。

09:37.413 --> 09:41.068
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

09:44.413 --> 09:46.137
- All right, Jelly Fishers,
- 好吧，果冻渔民，

09:46.206 --> 09:50.172
it's the moment
you've all been waiting for.
就是现在
